#. なぁ、苗木…
#. ちょっと内緒の話があるっつーか…
msgctxt "0001 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Hey, Makoto. I have something to tell you, but...it's\n"
"kind of a secret."
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、オレの部屋に来いよ。
msgctxt "0002 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Could you, uh, come to my room?"
msgstr ""

#. 桑田クンの…部屋に？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Your room...?"
msgstr ""

#. …んじゃ！　待ってるかんな！！
msgctxt "0004 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Anyway, I'll be waiting!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クン…急に部屋に呼び出すなんて…
#. どうしたんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder why Leon suddenly invited me to his room like\n"
"that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンに言われた通り、
#. ボクはすぐに彼の部屋へと向かった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I did what Leon asked and headed to his room right\n"
"away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ようこそ！　ここがスーパースターの部屋だ！
msgctxt "0007 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Welcome to the room of a future superstar!"
msgstr ""

#. …それで、どうしたの？
#. 内緒の話があるとか言ってたよね？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So, what's up? You said you had a secret or something?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. いやー、なんつーか…
msgctxt "0010 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Well, okay, it's like..."
msgstr ""

#. 野球の試合してー！！
msgctxt "0011 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Let's play baseball!"
msgstr ""

#. なんて、ジョークジョークだよ、マキシマムジョーク！
#. オレが野球やりたいなんて、逆にこえーっつうの！
msgctxt "0012 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Kidding, kidding! That was a joke. Super joke! I hate\n"
"baseball, remember?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0013 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. はぁ…
msgctxt "0014 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Ahh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ…？　ジョークじゃない？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait...it sounds like it *wasn't* a joke.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、桑田クン…
#. 本当に野球を…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Leon, do you...want to start playing baseball again?"
msgstr ""

#. バ、バカ言ってんじゃねーって！！
msgctxt "0017 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about!? Don't be stupid...!"
msgstr ""

#. 言ってんだろ！？
#. や、野球なんて全然好きじゃねーって！
msgctxt "0018 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"How many times have I told you how much I totally hate\n"
"baseball!?"
msgstr ""

#. 好きじゃ…ねーって…
msgctxt "0019 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "I, like, don't like it at all!"
msgstr ""

#. …思ってたんだけどな。
msgctxt "0020 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "...is what I thought. But actually..."
msgstr ""

#. 実は、こんなに野球やんねーのって…
#. 初めてなんだよな…
msgctxt "0021 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"This is the longest I've ever gone without playing, ya\n"
"know?"
msgstr ""

#. 下手に才能あるせいで…
#. 昔から野球ばっかやらされてたからよ…
msgctxt "0022 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I mean, I was so good, they forced me to play like,\n"
"all the time."
msgstr ""

#. 離れてみて、自分の気持ちに気付いたって事？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And being away from the game for so long has made you\n"
"realize how you really feel?"
msgstr ""

#. クソ！　マインドコントロールだ！
#. 野球がオレを洗脳しやがった！！
msgctxt "0024 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Dammit! It's like mind control! Baseball brainwashed\n"
"me!"
msgstr ""

#. あー、でも、なんでもいいや！！
#. とにかく投げてー！　なんでもいいから打ちてー！
msgctxt "0025 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"But fine, whatever! I just wanna throw the ball around\n"
"a little!"
msgstr ""

#. クソッ！　でも野球は１人じゃ出来ねーよ！
msgctxt "0026 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "But I can't play baseball by myself!"
msgstr ""

#. ううっ、やっぱ…
#. こんな学園来るんじゃなかったんだ…
msgctxt "0027 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Ghh... I never shoulda come to this school!"
msgstr ""

#. く、桑田クン…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "L-Leon..."
msgstr ""

#. もし、この状況が学校の行事だとして…
#. そんで、それが全部終わったとしたらさ…
msgctxt "0029 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"If what's happening to us really is some kinda school\n"
"event thing, then when it's over..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ、オレはこの学校辞めるわ…
#. <CLT 3>前の学校に戻る<CLT>わ…
msgctxt "0030 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"...I think I'm gonna drop out and <CLT 3>go back to my old\n"
"school<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. きっと許してくんねーと思うけど…
#. チームメイトと監督に頭下げてみる…
msgctxt "0031 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Maybe my team won't want me back, but all I can do is\n"
"beg for their forgiveness and hope for the best."
msgstr ""

#. し、心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。
#. きっと、みんな許してくれるって。
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I-I don't think you have to worry about that. I'm sure\n"
"they'll be happy to have you back."
msgstr ""

#. 桑田クンの野球への気持ちを見せれば…
#. 本気で練習する姿を見せればさ…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you just show them how you really feel about\n"
"baseball, how you're willing to go to practice and—"
msgstr ""

#. …練習？
msgctxt "0034 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Practice?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、それは無理！
#. オレは練習だけは本気で嫌いだから！
msgctxt "0035 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Hell no! No way! I really, seriously hate practice!"
msgstr ""

#. 練習試合でも紅白戦でも試合しか出たくねーもん！
#. そもそも、オレに練習なんていらねーし！！
msgctxt "0036 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I don't need practice! I just wanna play the game!\n"
"Even an exhibition game or whatever!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そっか…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Oh..."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ…なんとかなるんじゃない…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well...I'm sure it'll all work out somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ま、オレという戦力を放っておける訳ねーし、
#. どーせ、すぐに許してくれんだろ！
msgctxt "0039 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, they can't just drop someone as good as me! I'm\n"
"sure they'll forgive me no problem!"
msgstr ""

#. 間違いねーって！　このオレだぜ！？
#. プロも大注目の甲子園のスーパースターだぜ！？
msgctxt "0040 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's me, right!? I'm the up-and-coming Koshien\n"
"Stadium Superstar!"
msgstr ""

#. へっへっへ！
#. 苗木も、応援ヨロシク！
msgctxt "0041 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Hehehe! You're gonna be there rooting for me, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…懲りない人だな…
#. でも、微妙に憎めないって言うか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think he's learned his lesson. But still...I\n"
"think it's impossible for me to hate him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが桑田クンって事なのかもしれない…
#. 彼と色々話せて、やっとわかってきた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He and I talked about so much together. Have I finally\n"
"met the real Leon...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、桑田クンと
#. <CLT><CLT 3>心が通じ合えた<CLT><CLT 4>って事なのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think Leon and I have <CLT><CLT 3>come to understand each\n"
"other<CLT><CLT 4> a lot better...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>桑田怜恩の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leon's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“動体視力”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Kinetic Depth Perception<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、桑田クンとたわいもない雑談をして、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We made a little more small talk, then I went back to\n"
"my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
